  "description": "Hangyeol loves music, but for some reason, he just cannot write love songs. Desperate for advice, he visits a fortune-teller, only to receive the strangest solution imaginable: \"\"If romance is too hard,\"\" the old man tells him, \"\"then at least try sleeping with someone. Anyone.\"\" Leaving with more questions than answers, a flustered Hangyeol somehow ends up surrounded by three very different men…in more ways than one. Caught between inspiration, temptation, and pure confusion, Hangyeol must figure out whether he can finally lose his innocence - and maybe find his muse along the way.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
